                                "sense_id": "3a2b3db7-fc92-39c5-bf2b-5b9a0dd6ef86",
                                "text": "A nire accurate division of plants, as connected with flowering and fructification, is into monocarpic, or those which flower but once, and perish; and into polycarpic, or those which flower and ripen seeds several times before the entire plant, root and branch, perish."
